    "model_design": "WHAT: Replace ResNet50 backbone with EfficientNet-B0 (timm.create_model) with a custom classification head (GlobalAvgPool + Dropout + Linear). Enable gradients for all layers. WHY: EfficientNet is more parameter-efficient and captures finer details in 256x256 images. HOW: Load pretrained EfficientNet-B0 from timm, remove original classifier, add nn.Sequential with adaptive avg pool, nn.Dropout(0.3), nn.Linear(1280, 1).",
    "training_evaluation": "WHAT: Train end-to-end with AdamW optimizer, CosineAnnealingLR, and FocalLoss (gamma=2.0, alpha=0.75). Use mixed precision and early stopping. WHY: End-to-end fine-tuning allows backbone to adapt to cactus features, potentially boosting AUC beyond 0.9998. HOW: Implement training loop with DataLoader shuffling, gradient scaling, and validation after each epoch. Save best model by AUC. Load best model for test inference."
